Package: strawwu-initramfs-hooks
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: strawwu-initd,
         python3
Recommends: initramfs-tools
Maintainer: StrawCoding <apt@wastebase.xyz>
Description: StrawWU installed-target initramfs hooks (disk boot)
 Strips casper/live-boot initramfs-tools hooks on installed systems and
 enforces BOOT=local for standard disk boot. Complements ISO initrd splice
 (strawwu-live-init / strawwu-live-bottom). Installed via target-setup
 before target-identity regenerates initramfs.
